{"3617320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "31 Room", "steam_appid": 3617320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >31 Room is a shooter puzzle game that challenges your brain and also your reflexes. Combining physics-based mechanics and strategic mind, the game gives you a fulfilling combination of problem-solving and skill.<br><br>Unravel the mystery between the AI (you) and the developers (Nawaf &amp; Mohammed). As you proceed, you get new tools with more complexity in puzzles along with more rewards for solving them. <br><br>Designed for two players only, 31 Room is a co-op game—you can't play by alone. Play with a buddy or drop into a random lobby to get through the challenges as a team. (In-game voice chat isn't supported.)</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >31 Room is a shooter puzzle game that challenges your brain and also your reflexes. Combining physics-based mechanics and strategic mind, the game gives you a fulfilling combination of problem-solving and skill.<br><br>Unravel the mystery between the AI (you) and the developers (Nawaf &amp; Mohammed). As you proceed, you get new tools with more complexity in puzzles along with more rewards for solving them. <br><br>Designed for two players only, 31 Room is a co-op game—you can't play by alone. Play with a buddy or drop into a random lobby to get through the challenges as a team. (In-game voice chat isn't supported.)</p>", "short_description": "Combining shooting with puzzles create unexpected result, which is fun(Sometimes). Play it with your friend!.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617320/177e1e8f6c165200d955fb24703997d742d1c88f/header.jpg?t=1779027409", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617320/b68ccc7095dbe72